Description: Aurora boot integration for Apple Silicon Macs (Debian)
 The initrd Aurora boots with (Apple hardware modules and the Mac's vendor
 firmware, the USB4 router, the display chain and early KMS, encrypted root
 unlock), GRUB settings that keep the boot logo on screen, and the unit
 presets an Aurora image is built in.
